Next I’m testing a hybrid MC variant: keep the shared whitened antithetic samples, but after each layer match each neuron’s sampled ReLU marginal mean/variance to the Gaussian moment implied by the sampled pre-activation mean/variance. This is a control-variate style correction; the risk is Gaussian bias.
